{"id":"97097770861ae3fa","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-prob2-submartingale.md","title":"ZFC Prob2 Submartingale","display":"df-zfc-prob2-submartingale — ZFC Prob2 Submartingale","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-prob2-submartingale","aliases":["58-df-zfc-prob2-submartingale","58-df-zfc-prob3-submartingale"],"display":"df-zfc-prob2-submartingale — ZFC Prob2 Submartingale","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-prob2-submartingale"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-prob2-submartingale</span><span>58-df-zfc-prob3-submartingale</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-prob2-submartingale — ZFC Prob2 Submartingale"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d139c8e88761c759\" href=\"?note=d139c8e88761c759\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation\">58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_\\bullet,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,I,\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\Sigma\\in V\">\\(X_\\bullet,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,I,\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\Sigma\\in V\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(I\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\)</span> are imported above</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S(Y,X,\\mathcal G,\\mathbb P)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S(Y,X,\\mathcal G,\\mathbb P)\\)</span> is the imported conditional-expectation predicate</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (代表元层可积性谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d139c8e88761c759\" href=\"?note=d139c8e88761c759\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation\">58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\\)</span> (可测函数谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2Submartingale}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb2Submartingale}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}submartingale}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb2Submartingale}_S\n(X_\\bullet,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,I,\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathbb P(\\Omega)=1\n\\land I\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathcal F_\\bullet:I\\to\\mathcal P(\\Sigma)\n\\land\\forall i\\leq j\\in I\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F_i,\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathcal F_i\\subseteq\\mathcal F_j\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land X_\\bullet:I\\to\\mathbb R^\\Omega\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S(X_i,\\Omega,\\Sigma,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(X_i;(\\Omega,\\mathcal F_i),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)))\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall i\\leq j\\in I\\;\n\\exists Y\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S(Y,X_j,\\mathcal F_i,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathbb P(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:X_i(\\omega)&gt;Y(\\omega)\\})=0\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}submartingale}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb2Submartingale}_S\n(X_\\bullet,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,I,\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathbb P(\\Omega)=1\n\\land I\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathcal F_\\bullet:I\\to\\mathcal P(\\Sigma)\n\\land\\forall i\\leq j\\in I\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F_i,\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathcal F_i\\subseteq\\mathcal F_j\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land X_\\bullet:I\\to\\mathbb R^\\Omega\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S(X_i,\\Omega,\\Sigma,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(X_i;(\\Omega,\\mathcal F_i),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)))\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall i\\leq j\\in I\\;\n\\exists Y\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S(Y,X_j,\\mathcal F_i,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathbb P(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:X_i(\\omega)&gt;Y(\\omega)\\})=0\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The a.e. inequality is stated against an explicitly quantified conditional-\nexpectation representative, which is invariant under the representative chosen.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-prob3-submartingale</code> is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation","status":"resolved","id":"d139c8e88761c759","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation","status":"resolved","id":"d139c8e88761c759","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (代表元层可积性谓词, see [[58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Measurable}_S$ (可测函数谓词, see [[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X_\\bullet,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,I,\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\Sigma\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"I\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S(Y,X,\\mathcal G,\\mathbb P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2Submartingale}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}submartingale}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb2Submartingale}_S\n(X_\\bullet,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,I,\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathbb P(\\Omega)=1\n\\land I\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathcal F_\\bullet:I\\to\\mathcal P(\\Sigma)\n\\land\\forall i\\leq j\\in I\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F_i,\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathcal F_i\\subseteq\\mathcal F_j\\bigr)\\\\\n&{}\\land X_\\bullet:I\\to\\mathbb R^\\Omega\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S(X_i,\\Omega,\\Sigma,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(X_i;(\\Omega,\\mathcal F_i),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)))\\right)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall i\\leq j\\in I\\;\n\\exists Y\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S(Y,X_j,\\mathcal F_i,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathbb P(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:X_i(\\omega)>Y(\\omega)\\})=0\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2238,"backlinks":[{"id":"f3992ad434a4dd9a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcProb2Submartingale}_S\\subseteq V^6$（次鞅谓词，见 [[../batch18/58-df-zfc-prob2-submartingale.md]]）"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3170","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-prob2-submartingale.md|58-df-zfc-prob2-submartingale]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","ca832ed6bc22f728","a740bdad87b97ac6","bbbec05fde1d3b01","d139c8e88761c759"]}